# CR 608.2b: Bot1 casts Torch the Tower bargained (sacrificing Mox Ruby) at Llanowar Elves; Bot2 responds with Lightning
# Bolt on its own Elves. The only target is illegal, so the spell does not resolve: no damage, no scry (Bot1 is never asked to
# arrange), and the Elves went to the graveyard by the Bolt, not exile. The bargain cost stays paid.

